name tikz-sfc
category Package
revision 49424
shortdesc Symbols collection for typesetting Sequential Function Chart (SFC) diagrams (PLC programs)
relocated 1
longdesc This package contains a collection of symbols for typesetting
longdesc Sequential Function Chart (SFC) diagrams in agreement with the
longdesc international standard IEC-61131-3/2013. It includes steps
longdesc (normal and initial), transitions, actions and actions
longdesc qualifiers (with and without time duration). It extends the
longdesc circuit library of TikZ and allows you to draw an SFC diagram
longdesc in same way you would draw any other circuit.
runfiles size=3
